@startuml Sequence_Telemetry
title Сбор телеметрии от устройства

participant "IoT Device" as DEV
participant "Mosquitto" as MQTT
participant "Telemetry Service" as TEL
database "Telemetry DB" as DB
actor User
participant "API Gateway" as GW

== Периодическая отправка телеметрии ==

DEV -> MQTT: Publish to\ndevices/{device_id}/telemetry\n{type, value, unit, timestamp}

MQTT -> TEL: Message: telemetry payload

TEL -> DB: INSERT telemetry record

note right of TEL
  Данные сохраняются
  асинхронно
end note

== Запрос телеметрии пользователем ==

User -> GW: GET /api/v1/telemetry?deviceId=xxx
GW -> TEL: Forward request
TEL -> DB: SELECT * FROM telemetry\nWHERE device_id = xxx
DB --> TEL: Telemetry records
TEL --> GW: JSON response
GW --> User: Telemetry data

@enduml
